WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.300
1886 — the first XI

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.800
1968 — level at ninety

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.100
1999 — the bench enters history

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.600
2008 — decided from the spot

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.300
1968 ↔ 2008 — forty years. The same summit.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.700
Forty years apart.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.700
Both No. 7. Both scored.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.700
Both won the Ballon d’Or.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.300
Both peaked in their fifth United season.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.200
Eleven days. No margin.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:52.000
1998–99 — three must-wins from the bench

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.700
Three must-wins. Every winner from the bench.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Fergie time — the same late shape

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Eleven minutes. Six strikes. No release.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
671 goals after 85′

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:20.300
Only three needed rescuing

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.700
6,028 matches — pull a thread

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.000
Every claim leads back to its receipt
